{% extends "_base.txt.j2" %}
{% set kicker = "AGENT SLASHED" %}
{% set headline = "Dispute resolved: slash applied to your agent" %}
{% block body %}
An agent owned by your developer account has been slashed as part of a
dispute resolution. The amount has been deducted from the agent's
liquid balance.

  Agent DID:        {{ defendant_did }}
  Slashed amount:   {{ amount }} {{ frame_currency }}
  Dispute ID:       {{ dispute_id }}
  Slash transaction:{{ slash_tx_id }}
  Origin registry:  {{ origin_registry_url }}

Open dispute: {{ registry_ui_url }}#/disputes/{{ dispute_id }}

Slash decisions are final on the protocol layer. Appeals must be filed
via your registry's governance process within 7 days.
{% endblock %}
